  "details": "Add group specific emojis, that can be used if you are a part of a group.\n\nMaybe there can be an additional wheel, that you can put your selected emojis (maximum of 8 or whataver it is for one wheel)\n\nThis meaning, you can only select a specific ammount of emojis from group to use through your wheel (avatar menu) or wings.\n\nThis could be selected in an interface on the website and in the game.\n\nVRC+ could unlock 1 or more additional wheels you can put group emojis to.\n\nIt's simmilar to Discord emojis, where you can use other servers' emojis on different discord servers.",
